  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/659/659-96.htm",
  "statuteText": "659:96 Ballots for Constitutional Amendments. –\n\nIf a question to voters is submitted to the vote of the people on a special and separate ballot as provided in RSA 663:2, then those ballots shall be sealed and certified in a separate container as provided in RSA 659:95 except as provided in RSA 659:97."
